Propose a fixture-only authoritative Snapshot cursor/progress confirmation when telemetry appears stale; refresh/check the byte/debt observation and keep every idle/debt/R-spacing assertion and the30s rule. Do not widen a throughput/wall budget or change checkpoint policy. Oracle decides the fix after this read-only report.

